## [Items](items)

### [the Lens](beacon_lens)
---
Type: item/quest
Art: unknown
Tier: 5
---
The focusing array: the piece that takes the Voice's noise and bends it into one coherent
line. Without it the Beacon shouts in every direction at once and reaches nobody.

### [Kralien optics](kralien_optics)
---
Type: item/salvage
Art: unknown
Price: 180
---
Cut glass a thousand years old and still true. Eddy will not know what it is worth, which
means he will pay too much or too little and be pleased either way.

### [a survey slate](clue_slate)
---
Type: item/quest
Art: unknown
---
A Kralien survey slate, scratched rather than printed - the work of somebody in a hurry.
It marks a warren in the ash fields, and something they were carrying to it.

## [Relics](relics)

### [The Lens](lens)
---
Atmosphere: blue
Containment: tractor
Scrape band: 140
Margin: 80
Forbid jump: yes
Seed: 34
Art: plain_asteroid_7, plain_asteroid_8, plain_asteroid_10, plain_asteroid_11
---
A Kralien megastructure, dark and cold, built to the same giant scale as the Torgoth
station and by hands that thought about it completely differently.

### [the aperture](aperture)
---
Relic: lens
Box: -3400, 0, 0, 900, 500, 500
---
The way in - a machined mouth, square-cut, on the end of a structure that is otherwise all
curves. The Kralien squared off whatever had to be exact.

### [the gallery](gallery)
---
Relic: lens
Chamber: -1700, 0, 0, 1100
---
Bored, not built. The walls are smooth in a way no tool leaves.

### [the ring](ring)
---
Relic: lens
Chamber: 200, 0, 600, 1300
Passage to: gallery 320
---
The structure turns here. Everything past this point is aimed at the same spot.

### [the drum](drum)
---
Relic: lens
Chamber: 2100, -300, 1800, 1000
Passage to: ring 300
---
The focusing chamber. It is a sphere because it had to be a sphere.

### [the collar](collar)
---
Relic: lens
Box: 2100, -300, 1800, 700, 240, 700
---
Machined, and set into the drum - the mount the Lens sits in. A box inside a sphere: the
two ways of building, in the one room that mattered.

### [the gallery pillar](gallery_solid)
